      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "后冠路线的赛马娘们，就像是把接力棒各\n自交给后继者一样……不断传承，不断连结。",
      "source_fingerprint": "5acf7aa71b099c3201348f4a9a1411adb98be0c637beaea5a839f09d1b40d94a",
